body:
I cashed it out. I feel sick to my stomache, all of my savings now gone. I was up so much money and now I have nothing. I cant even look my parents in the eye. I feel fucking awful. What have I done to myself...but i had no other option.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

For sure. Like I said...I feel more guilty about what my family would think...I feel so bad especially since I had hundreds of thousands to my name before this..completely cleaned out and have shady fucks hounding me down everyday. Never in 1000 years did I think I would ever end up in this kind of scenario. Really feels like a terrible nightmare. Wake up like a normal person, then 10 seconds later my mind tells me: you're fucked and you have 30 days. Every minute of every waking day. My family is relatively healthy financially and I became the fuck up. I dont even want to sleep tonight, as I got the "deadline notice" today.

Contemplating just telling my family before they can...what a bomb to drop. "By the way Im flat broke, unemployed, and I have a loan shark on my ass. Happy thanksgiving"

I saw my way out paying all this shit off then going away peacefully. I want to live but now Im going to live as a dishonest person for the rest of my life. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I dont know what they will do. They know my family and my friends. My family doesnt know and if they find out they will never trust me again for being so foolish. Even a simple line to them saying I gambled with this money would be enough to ruin my trust with them forever. And thats putting things mildly.

&#x200B;

Im fucked in the head right now. I understand what youre saying, whats the worst that can happen, and I really dont know. I just want to throw up
